	<p>
		Hey, I'm Eain—COO at <a href="https://appliscale.io">Appliscale</a>, a digital engineering firm specialising in scalable, high-performance systems. Based in Wexford, Ireland, I lead a team of 80+ engineers across our Poland and Ireland offices, helping clients build systems that handle millions of users and billions of events.
	</p>

	<p>
		I love the challenge of helping companies scale. My focus is on building strong engineering culture, delivering mission-critical systems, and bridging the gap between technical excellence and business outcomes.
	</p>

	<h2>What we do at Appliscale</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Build systems serving 4+ million concurrent users with millisecond response times</li>
		<li>Process 400+ million daily events for enterprise clients</li>
		<li>Cloud consulting, custom development, and systems architecture</li>
		<li>Partners with AWS, Databricks, and Datadog</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Background</h2>
	<p>
		Before Appliscale, I spent nearly a decade at AOL Platforms, most recently as Chief of Staff managing globally distributed teams across Dublin, Frankfurt, Paris, Boston, and San Francisco. I hold a Masters in Business from the Irish Management Institute and a Diploma in Strategy & Innovation from University College Cork.
	</p>

	<h2>Giving back</h2>
	<p>
		I'm a long-time volunteer with Junior Achievement, serving as a classroom volunteer, event organiser, and regional Young Business judge since 2009.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm always interested in connecting with others working on scale challenges. Reach me via
		<a href="mailto:hello@eainjon.es">hello@eainjon.es</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/eainjones/">LinkedIn</a>.
	</p>
